{"bookId":"nahum","version":"kjv-strong","source":"eBible KJV2006 USFM","chapters":{"1":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The burden of Nineveh. The book of the vision of Nahum the Elkoshite.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"burden","strongs":["H4853"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":". The"},{"text":"book","strongs":["H5612"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"vision","strongs":["H2377"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Nahum","strongs":["H5151"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"Elkoshite","strongs":["H0512"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"God is jealous, and the LORD revengeth; the LORD revengeth, and is furious; the LORD will take vengeance on his adversaries, and he reserveth wrath for his enemies.","tokens":[{"text":"God","strongs":["H0410"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"jealous","strongs":["H7072"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"revengeth","strongs":["H5358"]},{"text":"; the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"revengeth","strongs":["H5358"]},{"text":", and is"},{"text":"furious","strongs":["H1167"]},{"text":"; the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"will take"},{"text":"vengeance","strongs":["H5358"]},{"text":"on his"},{"text":"adversaries","strongs":["H6862"]},{"text":", and he"},{"text":"reserveth","strongs":["H5201"]},{"text":"wrath for his"},{"text":"enemies","strongs":["H0341"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"The LORD is slow to anger, and great in power, and will not at all acquit the wicked: the LORD hath his way in the whirlwind and in the storm, and the clouds are the dust of his feet.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"slow","strongs":["H0750"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"power","strongs":["H3581"]},{"text":", and will not at"},{"text":"all","strongs":["H5352"]},{"text":"acquit","strongs":["H5352"]},{"text":"the wicked: the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"hath his"},{"text":"way","strongs":["H1870"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"whirlwind","strongs":["H5492"]},{"text":"and in the"},{"text":"storm","strongs":["H8183"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"clouds","strongs":["H6051"]},{"text":"are the"},{"text":"dust","strongs":["H0080"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"feet","strongs":["H7272"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"He rebuketh the sea, and maketh it dry, and drieth up all the rivers: Bashan languisheth, and Carmel, and the flower of Lebanon languisheth.","tokens":[{"text":"He"},{"text":"rebuketh","strongs":["H1605"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":", and maketh it"},{"text":"dry","strongs":["H2717"]},{"text":", and drieth"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H3001"]},{"text":"all the"},{"text":"rivers","strongs":["H5104"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"Bashan","strongs":["H1316"]},{"text":"languisheth","strongs":["H0535"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"Carmel","strongs":["H3760"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"flower","strongs":["H6525"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Lebanon","strongs":["H3844"]},{"text":"languisheth","strongs":["H0535"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"The mountains quake at him, and the hills melt, and the earth is burned at his presence, yea, the world, and all that dwell therein.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"mountains","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":"quake","strongs":["H7493"]},{"text":"at him, and the"},{"text":"hills","strongs":["H1389"]},{"text":"melt","strongs":["H4127"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"burned","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"at his"},{"text":"presence","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":", yea, the"},{"text":"world","strongs":["H8398"]},{"text":", and all that"},{"text":"dwell","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"therein."}]},{"number":6,"text":"Who can stand before his indignation? and who can abide in the fierceness of his anger? his fury is poured out like fire, and the rocks are thrown down by him.","tokens":[{"text":"Who can"},{"text":"stand","strongs":["H5975"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"indignation","strongs":["H2195"]},{"text":"? and who can"},{"text":"abide","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"fierceness","strongs":["H2740"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":"? his"},{"text":"fury","strongs":["H2534"]},{"text":"is poured"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H5413"]},{"text":"like"},{"text":"fire","strongs":["H0784"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"rocks","strongs":["H6697"]},{"text":"are thrown"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H5422"]},{"text":"by him."}]},{"number":7,"text":"The LORD is good, a strong hold in the day of trouble; and he knoweth them that trust in him.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"good","strongs":["H2896"]},{"text":", a strong"},{"text":"hold","strongs":["H4581"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"trouble","strongs":["H6869"]},{"text":"; and he"},{"text":"knoweth","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"them that"},{"text":"trust","strongs":["H2620"]},{"text":"in him."}]},{"number":8,"text":"But with an overrunning flood he will make an utter end of the place thereof, and darkness shall pursue his enemies.","tokens":[{"text":"But with an"},{"text":"overrunning","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":"flood","strongs":["H7858"]},{"text":"he will"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"an utter"},{"text":"end","strongs":["H3617"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"place","strongs":["H4725"]},{"text":"thereof, and"},{"text":"darkness","strongs":["H2822"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"pursue","strongs":["H7291"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"enemies","strongs":["H0341"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"What do ye imagine against the LORD? he will make an utter end: affliction shall not rise up the second time.","tokens":[{"text":"What do ye"},{"text":"imagine","strongs":["H2803"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"? he will"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"an utter"},{"text":"end","strongs":["H3617"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"affliction","strongs":["H6869"]},{"text":"shall not rise"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":"the second"},{"text":"time","strongs":["H6471"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"For while they be folden together as thorns, and while they are drunken as drunkards, they shall be devoured as stubble fully dry.","tokens":[{"text":"For while they be folden"},{"text":"together","strongs":["H5440"]},{"text":"as"},{"text":"thorns","strongs":["H5518"]},{"text":", and while they are"},{"text":"drunken","strongs":["H5433"]},{"text":"as"},{"text":"drunkards","strongs":["H5435"]},{"text":", they shall be"},{"text":"devoured","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"as"},{"text":"stubble","strongs":["H7179"]},{"text":"fully","strongs":["H4392"]},{"text":"dry","strongs":["H3002"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"There is one come out of thee, that imagineth evil against the LORD, a wicked counsellor.","tokens":[{"text":"There is one come"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H3318"]},{"text":"of thee, that"},{"text":"imagineth","strongs":["H2803"]},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", a"},{"text":"wicked","strongs":["H1100"]},{"text":"counsellor","strongs":["H3289"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"Thus saith the LORD; Though they be quiet, and likewise many, yet thus shall they be cut down, when he shall pass through. Though I have afflicted thee, I will afflict thee no more.","tokens":[{"text":"Thus"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"; Though they be"},{"text":"quiet","strongs":["H8003"]},{"text":", and likewise"},{"text":"many","strongs":["H7227"]},{"text":", yet thus shall they be cut"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H1494"]},{"text":", when he shall pass"},{"text":"through","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":". Though I have"},{"text":"afflicted","strongs":["H6031"]},{"text":"thee, I will"},{"text":"afflict","strongs":["H6031"]},{"text":"thee no more."}]},{"number":13,"text":"For now will I break his yoke from off thee, and will burst thy bonds in sunder.","tokens":[{"text":"For now will I"},{"text":"break","strongs":["H7665"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"yoke","strongs":["H4132"]},{"text":"from off thee, and will"},{"text":"burst","strongs":["H5423"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"bonds","strongs":["H4147"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"sunder","strongs":["H5423"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":14,"text":"And the LORD hath given a commandment concerning thee, that no more of thy name be sown: out of the house of thy gods will I cut off the graven image and the molten image: I will make thy grave; for thou art vile.","tokens":[{"text":"And the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"hath given a"},{"text":"commandment","strongs":["H6680"]},{"text":"concerning thee, that no more of thy"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"be"},{"text":"sown","strongs":["H2232"]},{"text":": out of the"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"of thy"},{"text":"gods","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"will I cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":"the graven"},{"text":"image","strongs":["H6459"]},{"text":"and the molten"},{"text":"image","strongs":["H4541"]},{"text":": I will"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"grave","strongs":["H6913"]},{"text":"; for thou art"},{"text":"vile","strongs":["H7043"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"Behold upon the mountains the feet of him that bringeth good tidings, that publisheth peace! O Judah, keep thy solemn feasts, perform thy vows: for the wicked shall no more pass through thee; he is utterly cut off.","tokens":[{"text":"Behold upon the"},{"text":"mountains","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"feet","strongs":["H7272"]},{"text":"of him that bringeth good"},{"text":"tidings","strongs":["H1319"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"publisheth","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":"peace","strongs":["H7965"]},{"text":"! O"},{"text":"Judah","strongs":["H3063"]},{"text":","},{"text":"keep","strongs":["H2287"]},{"text":"thy solemn"},{"text":"feasts","strongs":["H2282"]},{"text":","},{"text":"perform","strongs":["H7999"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"vows","strongs":["H5088"]},{"text":": for the"},{"text":"wicked","strongs":["H1100"]},{"text":"shall no"},{"text":"more","strongs":["H3254"]},{"text":"pass"},{"text":"through","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":"thee; he is utterly cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":"."}]}]},"2":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"He that dasheth in pieces is come up before thy face: keep the munition, watch the way, make thy loins strong, fortify thy power mightily.","tokens":[{"text":"He that dasheth in"},{"text":"pieces","strongs":["H6327"]},{"text":"is come"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":"before thy"},{"text":"face","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"keep","strongs":["H5341"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"munition","strongs":["H4694"]},{"text":","},{"text":"watch","strongs":["H6822"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"way","strongs":["H1870"]},{"text":", make thy"},{"text":"loins","strongs":["H4975"]},{"text":"strong","strongs":["H2388"]},{"text":","},{"text":"fortify","strongs":["H0553"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"power","strongs":["H3581"]},{"text":"mightily","strongs":["H3966"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"For the LORD hath turned away the excellency of Jacob, as the excellency of Israel: for the emptiers have emptied them out, and marred their vine branches.","tokens":[{"text":"For the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"hath turned"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"excellency","strongs":["H1347"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Jacob","strongs":["H3290"]},{"text":", as the"},{"text":"excellency","strongs":["H1347"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Israel","strongs":["H3478"]},{"text":": for the"},{"text":"emptiers","strongs":["H1238"]},{"text":"have emptied them"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H1238"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"marred","strongs":["H7843"]},{"text":"their vine"},{"text":"branches","strongs":["H2156"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"The shield of his mighty men is made red, the valiant men are in scarlet: the chariots shall be with flaming torches in the day of his preparation, and the fir trees shall be terribly shaken.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"shield","strongs":["H4043"]},{"text":"of his mighty"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H1368"]},{"text":"is made"},{"text":"red","strongs":["H0119"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"valiant","strongs":["H2428"]},{"text":"men","strongs":["H0582"]},{"text":"are in"},{"text":"scarlet","strongs":["H8529"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"chariots","strongs":["H7393"]},{"text":"shall be with"},{"text":"flaming","strongs":["H0784"]},{"text":"torches","strongs":["H6393"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"preparation","strongs":["H3559"]},{"text":", and the fir"},{"text":"trees","strongs":["H1265"]},{"text":"shall be terribly"},{"text":"shaken","strongs":["H7477"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"The chariots shall rage in the streets, they shall justle one against another in the broad ways: they shall seem like torches, they shall run like the lightnings.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"chariots","strongs":["H7393"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"rage","strongs":["H1984"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"streets","strongs":["H2351"]},{"text":", they shall justle one against"},{"text":"another","strongs":["H8264"]},{"text":"in the broad"},{"text":"ways","strongs":["H7339"]},{"text":": they shall"},{"text":"seem","strongs":["H4758"]},{"text":"like"},{"text":"torches","strongs":["H3940"]},{"text":", they shall"},{"text":"run","strongs":["H7323"]},{"text":"like the"},{"text":"lightnings","strongs":["H1300"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"He shall recount his worthies: they shall stumble in their walk; they shall make haste to the wall thereof, and the defence shall be prepared.","tokens":[{"text":"He shall"},{"text":"recount","strongs":["H2142"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"worthies","strongs":["H0117"]},{"text":": they shall"},{"text":"stumble","strongs":["H3782"]},{"text":"in their"},{"text":"walk","strongs":["H1979"]},{"text":"; they shall make"},{"text":"haste","strongs":["H4116"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"wall","strongs":["H2346"]},{"text":"thereof, and the"},{"text":"defence","strongs":["H5526"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"prepared","strongs":["H3559"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"The gates of the rivers shall be opened, and the palace shall be dissolved.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"gates","strongs":["H8179"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"rivers","strongs":["H5104"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"opened","strongs":["H6605"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"palace","strongs":["H1964"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"dissolved","strongs":["H4127"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"And Huzzab shall be led away captive, she shall be brought up, and her maids shall lead her as with the voice of doves, tabering upon their breasts.","tokens":[{"text":"And"},{"text":"Huzzab","strongs":["H5324"]},{"text":"shall be led away"},{"text":"captive","strongs":["H1540"]},{"text":", she shall be brought"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":", and her"},{"text":"maids","strongs":["H0519"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"lead","strongs":["H5090"]},{"text":"her as with the"},{"text":"voice","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"doves","strongs":["H3123"]},{"text":","},{"text":"tabering","strongs":["H8608"]},{"text":"upon their"},{"text":"breasts","strongs":["H3824"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"But Nineveh is of old like a pool of water: yet they shall flee away. Stand, stand, shall they cry; but none shall look back.","tokens":[{"text":"But"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":"is of"},{"text":"old","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"like a"},{"text":"pool","strongs":["H1295"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"water","strongs":["H4325"]},{"text":": yet they shall flee"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H5127"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Stand","strongs":["H5975"]},{"text":","},{"text":"stand","strongs":["H5975"]},{"text":", shall they cry; but none shall look"},{"text":"back","strongs":["H6437"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"Take ye the spoil of silver, take the spoil of gold: for there is none end of the store and glory out of all the pleasant furniture.","tokens":[{"text":"Take ye the"},{"text":"spoil","strongs":["H0962"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"silver","strongs":["H3701"]},{"text":", take the"},{"text":"spoil","strongs":["H0962"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"gold","strongs":["H2091"]},{"text":": for there is none"},{"text":"end","strongs":["H7097"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"store","strongs":["H8498"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"glory","strongs":["H3519"]},{"text":"out of all the"},{"text":"pleasant","strongs":["H2532"]},{"text":"furniture","strongs":["H3627"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"She is empty, and void, and waste: and the heart melteth, and the knees smite together, and much pain is in all loins, and the faces of them all gather blackness.","tokens":[{"text":"She is"},{"text":"empty","strongs":["H0950"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"void","strongs":["H4003"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"waste","strongs":["H1110"]},{"text":": and the"},{"text":"heart","strongs":["H3820"]},{"text":"melteth","strongs":["H4549"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"knees","strongs":["H1290"]},{"text":"smite"},{"text":"together","strongs":["H6375"]},{"text":", and much"},{"text":"pain","strongs":["H2479"]},{"text":"is in all"},{"text":"loins","strongs":["H4975"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"faces","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"of them all"},{"text":"gather","strongs":["H6908"]},{"text":"blackness","strongs":["H6289"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"Where is the dwelling of the lions, and the feedingplace of the young lions, where the lion, even the old lion, walked, and the lion’s whelp, and none made them afraid?","tokens":[{"text":"Where is the"},{"text":"dwelling","strongs":["H4583"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"lions","strongs":["H0738"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"feedingplace","strongs":["H4829"]},{"text":"of the young"},{"text":"lions","strongs":["H3715"]},{"text":", where the"},{"text":"lion","strongs":["H0738"]},{"text":", even the old"},{"text":"lion","strongs":["H3833"]},{"text":","},{"text":"walked","strongs":["H1980"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"lion’s","strongs":["H0738"]},{"text":"whelp","strongs":["H1482"]},{"text":", and none made them"},{"text":"afraid","strongs":["H2729"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":12,"text":"The lion did tear in pieces enough for his whelps, and strangled for his lionesses, and filled his holes with prey, and his dens with ravin.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"lion","strongs":["H0738"]},{"text":"did tear in"},{"text":"pieces","strongs":["H2963"]},{"text":"enough","strongs":["H1767"]},{"text":"for his"},{"text":"whelps","strongs":["H1484"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"strangled","strongs":["H2614"]},{"text":"for his"},{"text":"lionesses","strongs":["H3833"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"filled","strongs":["H4390"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"holes","strongs":["H2356"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"prey","strongs":["H2964"]},{"text":", and his"},{"text":"dens","strongs":["H4585"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"ravin","strongs":["H2966"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Behold, I am against thee, saith the LORD of hosts, and I will burn her chariots in the smoke, and the sword shall devour thy young lions: and I will cut off thy prey from the earth, and the voice of thy messengers shall no more be heard.","tokens":[{"text":"Behold, I am against thee,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":", and I will"},{"text":"burn","strongs":["H1197"]},{"text":"her"},{"text":"chariots","strongs":["H7393"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"smoke","strongs":["H6227"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"sword","strongs":["H2719"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"devour","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"thy young"},{"text":"lions","strongs":["H3715"]},{"text":": and I will cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"prey","strongs":["H2964"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"voice","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"of thy"},{"text":"messengers","strongs":["H4397"]},{"text":"shall no more be"},{"text":"heard","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":"."}]}]},"3":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Woe to the bloody city! it is all full of lies and robbery; the prey departeth not;","tokens":[{"text":"Woe","strongs":["H1945"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"bloody","strongs":["H1818"]},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":"! it is all"},{"text":"full","strongs":["H4392"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"lies","strongs":["H3585"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"robbery","strongs":["H6563"]},{"text":"; the"},{"text":"prey","strongs":["H2964"]},{"text":"departeth","strongs":["H4185"]},{"text":"not;"}]},{"number":2,"text":"The noise of a whip, and the noise of the rattling of the wheels, and of the pransing horses, and of the jumping chariots.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"noise","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"of a"},{"text":"whip","strongs":["H7752"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"noise","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"rattling","strongs":["H7494"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"wheels","strongs":["H0212"]},{"text":", and of the"},{"text":"pransing","strongs":["H1725"]},{"text":"horses","strongs":["H5483"]},{"text":", and of the"},{"text":"jumping","strongs":["H7540"]},{"text":"chariots","strongs":["H4818"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"The horseman lifteth up both the bright sword and the glittering spear: and there is a multitude of slain, and a great number of carcases; and there is none end of their corpses; they stumble upon their corpses:","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"horseman","strongs":["H6571"]},{"text":"lifteth"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":"both the"},{"text":"bright","strongs":["H3851"]},{"text":"sword","strongs":["H2719"]},{"text":"and the"},{"text":"glittering","strongs":["H1300"]},{"text":"spear","strongs":["H2595"]},{"text":": and there is a"},{"text":"multitude","strongs":["H7230"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"slain","strongs":["H2491"]},{"text":", and a"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H3514"]},{"text":"number of"},{"text":"carcases","strongs":["H6297"]},{"text":"; and there is none"},{"text":"end","strongs":["H7097"]},{"text":"of their"},{"text":"corpses","strongs":["H1472"]},{"text":"; they"},{"text":"stumble","strongs":["H3782"]},{"text":"upon their"},{"text":"corpses","strongs":["H1472"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":4,"text":"Because of the multitude of the whoredoms of the wellfavoured harlot, the mistress of witchcrafts, that selleth nations through her whoredoms, and families through her witchcrafts.","tokens":[{"text":"Because of the"},{"text":"multitude","strongs":["H7230"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"whoredoms","strongs":["H2183"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"wellfavoured","strongs":["H2896"]},{"text":"harlot","strongs":["H2181"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"mistress","strongs":["H1172"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"witchcrafts","strongs":["H3785"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"selleth","strongs":["H4376"]},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"through her"},{"text":"whoredoms","strongs":["H2183"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"families","strongs":["H4940"]},{"text":"through her"},{"text":"witchcrafts","strongs":["H3785"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"Behold, I am against thee, saith the LORD of hosts; and I will discover thy skirts upon thy face, and I will shew the nations thy nakedness, and the kingdoms thy shame.","tokens":[{"text":"Behold, I am against thee,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"; and I will"},{"text":"discover","strongs":["H1540"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"skirts","strongs":["H7757"]},{"text":"upon thy"},{"text":"face","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":", and I will"},{"text":"shew","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"nakedness","strongs":["H4626"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"kingdoms","strongs":["H4467"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"shame","strongs":["H7036"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"And I will cast abominable filth upon thee, and make thee vile, and will set thee as a gazingstock.","tokens":[{"text":"And I will"},{"text":"cast","strongs":["H7993"]},{"text":"abominable"},{"text":"filth","strongs":["H8251"]},{"text":"upon thee, and make thee"},{"text":"vile","strongs":["H5034"]},{"text":", and will"},{"text":"set","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"thee as a"},{"text":"gazingstock","strongs":["H7210"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"And it shall come to pass, that all they that look upon thee shall flee from thee, and say, Nineveh is laid waste: who will bemoan her? whence shall I seek comforters for thee?","tokens":[{"text":"And it shall come to pass, that all they that"},{"text":"look","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"upon thee shall"},{"text":"flee","strongs":["H5074"]},{"text":"from thee, and"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":"is laid"},{"text":"waste","strongs":["H7703"]},{"text":": who will"},{"text":"bemoan","strongs":["H5110"]},{"text":"her?"},{"text":"whence","strongs":["H0370"]},{"text":"shall I"},{"text":"seek","strongs":["H1245"]},{"text":"comforters","strongs":["H5162"]},{"text":"for thee?"}]},{"number":8,"text":"Art thou better than populous No, that was situate among the rivers, that had the waters round about it, whose rampart was the sea, and her wall was from the sea?","tokens":[{"text":"Art thou"},{"text":"better","strongs":["H3190"]},{"text":"than"},{"text":"populous","strongs":["H0527"]},{"text":"No","strongs":["H4996"]},{"text":", that was"},{"text":"situate","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"among the"},{"text":"rivers","strongs":["H2975"]},{"text":", that had the"},{"text":"waters","strongs":["H4325"]},{"text":"round"},{"text":"about","strongs":["H5439"]},{"text":"it, whose"},{"text":"rampart","strongs":["H2426"]},{"text":"was the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":", and her"},{"text":"wall","strongs":["H2346"]},{"text":"was from the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":9,"text":"Ethiopia and Egypt were her strength, and it was infinite; Put and Lubim were thy helpers.","tokens":[{"text":"Ethiopia","strongs":["H3568"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"Egypt","strongs":["H4714"]},{"text":"were her"},{"text":"strength","strongs":["H6109"]},{"text":", and it was"},{"text":"infinite","strongs":["H0369"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"Put","strongs":["H6316"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"Lubim","strongs":["H3864"]},{"text":"were thy"},{"text":"helpers","strongs":["H5833"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"Yet was she carried away, she went into captivity: her young children also were dashed in pieces at the top of all the streets: and they cast lots for her honourable men, and all her great men were bound in chains.","tokens":[{"text":"Yet was she carried"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H1473"]},{"text":", she"},{"text":"went","strongs":["H1980"]},{"text":"into"},{"text":"captivity","strongs":["H7628"]},{"text":": her young"},{"text":"children","strongs":["H5768"]},{"text":"also were dashed in"},{"text":"pieces","strongs":["H7376"]},{"text":"at the"},{"text":"top","strongs":["H7218"]},{"text":"of all the"},{"text":"streets","strongs":["H2351"]},{"text":": and they"},{"text":"cast","strongs":["H3032"]},{"text":"lots","strongs":["H1486"]},{"text":"for her honourable"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H3513"]},{"text":", and all her great"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"were"},{"text":"bound","strongs":["H7576"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"chains","strongs":["H2131"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"Thou also shalt be drunken: thou shalt be hid, thou also shalt seek strength because of the enemy.","tokens":[{"text":"Thou also shalt be"},{"text":"drunken","strongs":["H7937"]},{"text":": thou shalt be"},{"text":"hid","strongs":["H5956"]},{"text":", thou also shalt"},{"text":"seek","strongs":["H1245"]},{"text":"strength","strongs":["H4581"]},{"text":"because of the"},{"text":"enemy","strongs":["H0341"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"All thy strong holds shall be like fig trees with the firstripe figs: if they be shaken, they shall even fall into the mouth of the eater.","tokens":[{"text":"All thy strong"},{"text":"holds","strongs":["H4013"]},{"text":"shall be like fig"},{"text":"trees","strongs":["H8384"]},{"text":"with the firstripe"},{"text":"figs","strongs":["H1061"]},{"text":": if they be"},{"text":"shaken","strongs":["H5128"]},{"text":", they shall even"},{"text":"fall","strongs":["H5307"]},{"text":"into the"},{"text":"mouth","strongs":["H6310"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"eater","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Behold, thy people in the midst of thee are women: the gates of thy land shall be set wide open unto thine enemies: the fire shall devour thy bars.","tokens":[{"text":"Behold, thy"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"of thee are"},{"text":"women","strongs":["H0802"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"gates","strongs":["H8179"]},{"text":"of thy"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"shall be set"},{"text":"wide","strongs":["H6605"]},{"text":"open","strongs":["H6605"]},{"text":"unto thine"},{"text":"enemies","strongs":["H0341"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"fire","strongs":["H0784"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"devour","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"bars","strongs":["H1280"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":14,"text":"Draw thee waters for the siege, fortify thy strong holds: go into clay, and tread the morter, make strong the brickkiln.","tokens":[{"text":"Draw","strongs":["H7579"]},{"text":"thee"},{"text":"waters","strongs":["H4325"]},{"text":"for the"},{"text":"siege","strongs":["H4692"]},{"text":","},{"text":"fortify","strongs":["H2388"]},{"text":"thy strong"},{"text":"holds","strongs":["H4013"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"go","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"into"},{"text":"clay","strongs":["H2916"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"tread","strongs":["H7429"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"morter","strongs":["H2563"]},{"text":", make"},{"text":"strong","strongs":["H2388"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"brickkiln","strongs":["H4404"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"There shall the fire devour thee; the sword shall cut thee off, it shall eat thee up like the cankerworm: make thyself many as the cankerworm, make thyself many as the locusts.","tokens":[{"text":"There shall the"},{"text":"fire","strongs":["H0784"]},{"text":"devour","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"thee; the"},{"text":"sword","strongs":["H2719"]},{"text":"shall cut thee"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":", it shall eat thee"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"like the"},{"text":"cankerworm","strongs":["H3218"]},{"text":": make thyself"},{"text":"many","strongs":["H3513"]},{"text":"as the"},{"text":"cankerworm","strongs":["H3218"]},{"text":", make thyself"},{"text":"many","strongs":["H3513"]},{"text":"as the"},{"text":"locusts","strongs":["H0697"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":16,"text":"Thou hast multiplied thy merchants above the stars of heaven: the cankerworm spoileth, and flieth away.","tokens":[{"text":"Thou hast"},{"text":"multiplied","strongs":["H7235"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"merchants","strongs":["H7402"]},{"text":"above the"},{"text":"stars","strongs":["H3556"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"heaven","strongs":["H8064"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"cankerworm","strongs":["H3218"]},{"text":"spoileth","strongs":["H6584"]},{"text":", and flieth"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H5774"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"Thy crowned are as the locusts, and thy captains as the great grasshoppers, which camp in the hedges in the cold day, but when the sun ariseth they flee away, and their place is not known where they are.","tokens":[{"text":"Thy"},{"text":"crowned","strongs":["H4502"]},{"text":"are as the"},{"text":"locusts","strongs":["H0697"]},{"text":", and thy"},{"text":"captains","strongs":["H2951"]},{"text":"as the great"},{"text":"grasshoppers","strongs":["H1462"]},{"text":", which"},{"text":"camp","strongs":["H2583"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"hedges","strongs":["H1448"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"cold","strongs":["H7135"]},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":", but when the"},{"text":"sun","strongs":["H8121"]},{"text":"ariseth","strongs":["H2224"]},{"text":"they flee"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H5074"]},{"text":", and their"},{"text":"place","strongs":["H4725"]},{"text":"is not"},{"text":"known","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"where","strongs":["H0335"]},{"text":"they are."}]},{"number":18,"text":"Thy shepherds slumber, O king of Assyria: thy nobles shall dwell in the dust: thy people is scattered upon the mountains, and no man gathereth them.","tokens":[{"text":"Thy"},{"text":"shepherds","strongs":["H7462"]},{"text":"slumber","strongs":["H5123"]},{"text":", O"},{"text":"king","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Assyria","strongs":["H0804"]},{"text":": thy"},{"text":"nobles","strongs":["H0117"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"dwell","strongs":["H7931"]},{"text":"in the dust: thy"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"scattered","strongs":["H6335"]},{"text":"upon the"},{"text":"mountains","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":", and no man"},{"text":"gathereth","strongs":["H6908"]},{"text":"them."}]},{"number":19,"text":"There is no healing of thy bruise; thy wound is grievous: all that hear the bruit of thee shall clap the hands over thee: for upon whom hath not thy wickedness passed continually?","tokens":[{"text":"There is no"},{"text":"healing","strongs":["H3545"]},{"text":"of thy"},{"text":"bruise","strongs":["H7667"]},{"text":"; thy"},{"text":"wound","strongs":["H4347"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"grievous","strongs":["H2470"]},{"text":": all that"},{"text":"hear","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"bruit","strongs":["H8088"]},{"text":"of thee shall"},{"text":"clap","strongs":["H8628"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"hands","strongs":["H3709"]},{"text":"over thee: for upon whom hath not thy"},{"text":"wickedness","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"passed","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":"continually","strongs":["H8548"]},{"text":"?"}]}]}}}